WEBVTT

00:45:27.505 --> 00:45:33.254
RD: I think there's a general
mistaken belief --

00:45:33.278 --> 00:45:36.247
I communicate a lot with the people
that you're saying,

00:45:36.271 --> 00:45:39.072
people in positions of power,

00:45:39.096 --> 00:45:43.125
whether they're both in government
or other places, and so on.

00:45:43.149 --> 00:45:45.778
I think what you basically have to realize

00:45:45.802 --> 00:45:49.913
is that very few people
are making decisions

00:45:49.937 --> 00:45:54.842
based on the quality of the argument.

00:45:54.866 --> 00:45:57.725
That most people are --

00:45:57.749 --> 00:46:02.107
Most of those are in a war of some kind